  "topography": {
    "project_purpose": "Anvil is a collateral-management protocol for fully backed credit and letter-of-credit guarantees. It enables users to deposit collateral into vaults and issue letters of credit or credit guarantees backed by that collateral, rather than operating primarily as an overcollateralized lending market.",
